{"3618330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Area 75", "steam_appid": 3618330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4857770], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/683eed64dfd1d0d2f148196a83200349.avif?t=1783603567\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We are members of an elite special forces unit known as the Night Owls. We are being sent to a secret military laboratory where they are experimenting with dark matter. Our main mission will be to extract highly classified data from Sector 21, as for some reason their transfer has been interrupted. One of the other main orders is to clear the path there, as chaos has completely broken out in some sectors. We join the story from Rick Gerrison's perspective.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Take down the terror and save the Humanity with the Dark Matter!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Combat Variants:</strong> In the game, you can assemble your combat strategy from three weapon variants, as you may need everything to survive! In addition to traditional firearms, you can also take control of Hybrid Technology-equipped devices and the forces of darkness. Use them wisely, as danger lurks around every corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Power Abilities:</strong> Rick is the only person chosen by the dark matter. Control the dark forces with which you can unleash brutal powers, or manipulate time with that power. The decision is in your hands!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/5c90324e629fc05387c61b9c6253bbd5.poster.avif?t=1783603567\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/5c90324e629fc05387c61b9c6253bbd5.webm?t=1783603567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic-Evolved Combat System: </strong>Engage in raw, physical combat that combines traditional weapons and the special powers of darkness, providing you with unique abilities. Adapt to enemies and environments as you complete your mission. Your inventory and abilities will evolve as you progress through the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/d3775d3994566932e048e356bce8207a.poster.avif?t=1783603567\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/d3775d3994566932e048e356bce8207a.webm?t=1783603567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Oriented Gameplay: </strong>As the story progresses, you'll uncover the secrets of the abandoned laboratory and the dark matter that permeates spacetime, while your companions provide you with crucial information via radio to aid your navigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Survival Gameplay:</strong> You must scavenge for weapons, resources, and equipment in a laboratory where every shadow hides danger. Face increasingly terrifying monsters and uncover the secrets of the lab while fighting for survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over-the-shoulder Camera:</strong> The fixed-camera viewpoints to an over-the-shoulder perspective, putting you closer to what Rick sees, for a more thrilling, more immersive experience as you explore the Labor and come face-to-face with monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/599a58543fd2ec6ba7c24c7cb13fadd8.poster.avif?t=1783603567\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/599a58543fd2ec6ba7c24c7cb13fadd8.webm?t=1783603567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time attacks: </strong>Whatever you do, don’t drop your guard. Everything takes place in real-time. That means any action you take, whether it be reloading or digging through your inventory, gives the monsters a perfect opportunity to attack. This nightmare has just begun and it’s up to get to the bottom of what happened here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for this mission? Humanity is counting on you!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/683eed64dfd1d0d2f148196a83200349.avif?t=1783603567\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We are members of an elite special forces unit known as the Night Owls. We are being sent to a secret military laboratory where they are experimenting with dark matter. Our main mission will be to extract highly classified data from Sector 21, as for some reason their transfer has been interrupted. One of the other main orders is to clear the path there, as chaos has completely broken out in some sectors. We join the story from Rick Gerrison's perspective.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Take down the terror and save the Humanity with the Dark Matter!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Combat Variants:</strong> In the game, you can assemble your combat strategy from three weapon variants, as you may need everything to survive! In addition to traditional firearms, you can also take control of Hybrid Technology-equipped devices and the forces of darkness. Use them wisely, as danger lurks around every corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Power Abilities:</strong> Rick is the only person chosen by the dark matter. Control the dark forces with which you can unleash brutal powers, or manipulate time with that power. The decision is in your hands!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/5c90324e629fc05387c61b9c6253bbd5.poster.avif?t=1783603567\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/5c90324e629fc05387c61b9c6253bbd5.webm?t=1783603567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic-Evolved Combat System: </strong>Engage in raw, physical combat that combines traditional weapons and the special powers of darkness, providing you with unique abilities. Adapt to enemies and environments as you complete your mission. Your inventory and abilities will evolve as you progress through the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/d3775d3994566932e048e356bce8207a.poster.avif?t=1783603567\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/d3775d3994566932e048e356bce8207a.webm?t=1783603567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Oriented Gameplay: </strong>As the story progresses, you'll uncover the secrets of the abandoned laboratory and the dark matter that permeates spacetime, while your companions provide you with crucial information via radio to aid your navigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Survival Gameplay:</strong> You must scavenge for weapons, resources, and equipment in a laboratory where every shadow hides danger. Face increasingly terrifying monsters and uncover the secrets of the lab while fighting for survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over-the-shoulder Camera:</strong> The fixed-camera viewpoints to an over-the-shoulder perspective, putting you closer to what Rick sees, for a more thrilling, more immersive experience as you explore the Labor and come face-to-face with monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/599a58543fd2ec6ba7c24c7cb13fadd8.poster.avif?t=1783603567\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/extras/599a58543fd2ec6ba7c24c7cb13fadd8.webm?t=1783603567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time attacks: </strong>Whatever you do, don’t drop your guard. Everything takes place in real-time. That means any action you take, whether it be reloading or digging through your inventory, gives the monsters a perfect opportunity to attack. This nightmare has just begun and it’s up to get to the bottom of what happened here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for this mission? Humanity is counting on you!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Area 75 is a story-driven Horror TPS-Shooter where you experience the chaos unfolding in a secret military laboratory, where they experimented with dark matter, from Rick Gerrison's perspective. Rick is the only person who can use these special powers. Be part of this story!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/98930dfaa5e9e0f85aacaca1f0a35a5e98b0d3eb/header.jpg?t=1783603567", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/b9ee226c57a3905c0bdd9a69eaaa33812cae558f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783603567", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618330/b9ee226c57a3905c0bdd9a69eaaa33812cae558f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783603567", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit), Windows 11 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400 or AMD Ryzen 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti (4GB) vagy AMD Radeon RX 570 (4GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Target 30-45 FPS at 1080p on Medium settings. </li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit), Windows 11 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K vagy AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 (6GB) vagy AMD Radeon RX 6600 (8GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card (Surround sound support recommended for the best experience)<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Target 60 FPS at 1080p on High settings.   Epic/4K Experience: For the ultimate experience using full Nanite and Lumen features at 4K resolution, we recommend 32 GB RAM, an RTX 3080 / RX 6800 XT or better, and an SSD. </li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended: